cy,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "urinary frequency and nocturnal, poor stream, hesitancy and terminal dribbling"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "413"}}, {"id": "body-25083", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Very often patients may present with bone pain including backache or pathological fracture", "runs": [{"text": "Very"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "often"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patients"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "present"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pain"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "including"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "backache"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pathological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fracture"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "413"}}, {"id": "body-25084", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Digital Rectal Examination (DRE) typically reveals a hard, irregular prostate. TURP is carried out to both confirm the diagnosis and also as part of the treatment (to relieve obstruction).", "runs": [{"text": "Digital Rectal Examination (DRE) typically reveals a hard, irregular prostate. TURP is carried out to both confirm the diagnosis and also as part of the treatment (to relieve obstruction)."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "413"}}, {"id": "body-25085", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Screening for prostate cancer", "runs": [{"text": "Screening"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "prostate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cancer"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-25086", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Routine screening not recommended, but when done should begin with PSA and digital rectal examination at age 50 if life expectancy is >10 years. It is recommended that screening of high-risk group should take place starting at age 45.", "runs": [{"text": "Routine screening not recommended, but when done should begin with PSA and digital rectal examination at age 50 if life"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "expectancy is >10 years. It is recommended that screening of high-risk group should take place starting at age 45."}]}, {"id": "body-25089", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-25090", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "FBC, LFT, Urea, Creatinine, Serum PSA, ALP, Testosterone", "runs": [{"text": "FBC,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "LFT,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Urea,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Creatinine,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Serum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "PSA,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ALP, "}, {"text": "Testosterone"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "413"}}, {"id": "body-25091", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "X-rays of the painful bone or spine", "runs": [{"text": "X-rays"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "painful"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " spine"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "413"}}, {"id": "body-25092", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "CXR", "runs": [{"text": "CXR"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "413"}}, {"id": "body-25093", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Abdomen and Pelvis USS and or CT scan", "runs": [{"text": "Abdomen"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Pelvis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "USS"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "CT"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scan"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "413"}}, {"id": "body-25095", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Pelvic MRI in early-stage disease", "runs": [{"text": "Pelvic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "MRI"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "early-stage"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dise